{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "4ca4efdaac0fbacf6af58928bbfe547133a0a1ead118e95c6461b04d2a044bad", "ja": "他のアイドルを見てたなんて、嘘だよね？", "zh": "说你在看其他偶像，是骗人的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b308b1a59a462b3340df6e5f923b2e14585110c512783a063d5f23dec13bb482", "ja": "ある日の劇場。亜美、志保、昴、エミリーに\n問い詰められるプロデューサー。事情を\n尋ねた美咲に、一同は語る。イベントで\n西エリアに行った際、プロデューサーが\n現地のアイドルにデレデレしていた、と。", "zh": "某天在剧场。制作人正被亚美、志保、\n昴和艾米莉质问着。在美咲询问情况后，\n大家说明了原委：活动前往西部区域时，\n制作人对着当地的偶像表现得嬉皮笑脸、神魂颠倒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "2d0d187a590b1cff7c758ef4cb18234ae467714081ffe9a89fd3961fc9ce6e71", "ja": "兄ちゃんの……\nバカーーーーーッ！！！", "zh": "哥哥他……大笨蛋——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "ed13a56c9d856ea3636274c4d4da1115a9cbeeafc0e3ec3fe5025798f9ccdd6e", "ja": "今の声は……亜美ちゃん？\nみんな、京都から戻ってきたのかな。", "zh": "刚才的声音是……亚美？\n大家是从京都回来了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "788af6fdc020b16f0aa3da980f5a915e6fe8f77981b609b1461ed6cec32812fd", "ja": "あ、亜美！　劇場に戻るなり\nそんな大声を出さなくても……。", "zh": "啊，亜美！才刚回到剧场，\n不用一回来就喊那么大声吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "43d284951065fa5b28ed2f6c331babbf0164c0d5eb0360f60f46f25ad43dd441", "ja": "これが叫ばずにいられるかー！\n兄ちゃんのバカバカバカ！　馬！　鹿！", "zh": "这让我怎么可能不喊出来嘛——！\n哥哥你这个大笨蛋大笨蛋大笨蛋！马！鹿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "1672b8c396f7e8c1a82cd5739683fdaba835f39553fee56dbb2824f899594b17", "ja": "オレも、今日の{$P$}には、\nちょっと言いたいことあるぜ！", "zh": "我对今天的{$P$}也有些话想说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "bbf172952817f926dfa25e2f899f8c8ca78c6d53facae0b85a5e37013bfad384", "ja": "なーんか、デレデレしてたっていうかさ……！", "zh": "总觉得你刚才一脸陶醉，怎么说呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "677f7372b544b2f9f2c16f0f8e9aaf7f4671eb531b2121228ff3454f108be1b0", "ja": "そうですね。具体的に言うと……\nちょっとだらしない顔をしていたと思います。", "zh": "是啊。具体来说……我觉得您当时的表情有点松懈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "6e02d462901b8dc534e62ff12717b58fd1e8b587d3cffec617d68f19a6c622a1", "ja": "もちろん、お仕事だという事はわかっています！\nわかっているんですけど……うう。", "zh": "我当然明白这是工作！\n虽然很明白……唔唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1008_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "ccb376cc7fcc7fa251cfbed5c7951f9ccffc164a57b9047b8554a95f84dad5aa", "ja": "あっ、やっぱり！　{$P$}さん、\nみんなも、お帰りなさい！", "zh": "啊，果然！{$P$}先生，\n大家也欢迎回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "871bccd83b413ce588ab17b8692c1b26212af5a3f78d8199cb0b7bc214154bf3", "ja": "あっ、青羽さん！\nお疲れ様です……。", "zh": "啊，青羽小姐！\n辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "b50fea47a997e60a3633bc9366c503ae739e10ecb1abfe79975d938849912e60", "ja": "なんだか大きな声がしましたけど、\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "刚才好像听到了很大的声音，出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "7442af66156de4c8f2eff1f6881948ad378c324078c7e20b8a7feb91d3e35d3d", "ja": "今日は西エリアで、\nイベントだったんですよね？", "zh": "今天是在西区有活动，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f749d601679718b3c5ea44d6a379fb2c8bedbceac074c16cf466bac41be1dafe", "ja": "ええ、そうなんです。\nただその西エリアでの仕事先で、ちょっと……。", "zh": "是的，没错。\n不过在西区那边工作的地方，出了点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1014_null", "source_sha256": "b085703609dccdfb5040a6e7eb1239e0a2575386f6f34637390e48d11f044d5f", "ja": "午前中、西エリア……", "zh": "上午，西部区域……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f582e0c023538311bf60b99ff137bc8317a80be40cfa3edfe48b76befc4f7db6", "ja": "みんな、移動お疲れ様！　事前に説明したとおり、\n今日の仕事はイベントへのゲスト出演と、取材だ。", "zh": "大家，辛苦赶路了！就像事先说明的那样，今天的工作是作为嘉宾参加活动，以及接受采访。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "dd68de3f7cdafb67edefc485e45e6e3b5fd1ce379c642e8613d354961290ac44", "ja": "有名なイベントっしょ？　西エリアのアイドルファンは\n誰でも知ってるって、亜美、ありさちんに聞いたよ！", "zh": "这是个很有名的活动吧？亚美听亚利沙说，西部地区的偶像粉丝没有不知道这个的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "03ee00a3325fd16ca00a78e606c17bb87bf7e57e9311b5cd4a68bf007d92fe5f", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。ツアーに先駆けて、まずは\n地元の人達にみんなの事を認知してもらわないとな。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样。正式开始巡演前，首先得让当地人认识大家才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "35642fc11afaee4c8dfe374a5376d65eb1016c0f8420f3a91137da46a9e982f4", "ja": "オッケー！　アウェイで\nちゃんと挨拶するのは、大事だもんな～。", "zh": "好的！在客场好好打招呼很重要嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "2fafe2a4a43ddb249be64e95ae2adddb0bb009eb8c0c49c8fb99a617f116832c", "ja": "イベントや取材で、顔を覚えてもらわなくちゃ……。\n疲れたなんて言ってられません。", "zh": "在活动和采访中，必须让大家记住我的脸……。\n不能说累了就算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3564883b3d6bdc6a79befdef4ca59a4a917932d8a3bdd207d36800f2346cf443", "ja": "今日はゲストだからパフォーマンスは少ないけど、\n来週の出演では、しっかり時間をもらう予定だ。", "zh": "今天是嘉宾，表演不多，不过下周出演时，打算好好争取一些时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "60b63c4d4ed20cd5675b570b6ccd7bb915ca3a65c78b87fcaefb01ab2782a077", "ja": "京都の大和撫子のみなさんと、共演させて\nいただけるんですね……楽しみです！", "zh": "能和京都的大和抚子们同台演出……真让人期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "efd7ea9a5705c4cd006afe6678c99d8dba5e26e2ee7b5970c87e74a33cd1a87f", "ja": "{$P$}、オレたちと\n共演するユニットってどんな感じ？", "zh": "{$P$}，和我们一起演出的组合是什么样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d25ff73df182779e29e019f20e2b7481ba8669f453fe006ec431d71e6946d284", "ja": "『D.O.S.S.』（どす）……十代後半が中心の\nユニットだな。西エリアでは、かなりの人気らしい。", "zh": "“D.O.S.S.”……是一个以十七八岁成员为中心的\n组合。在西区似乎相当有人气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4d90bf535451e8dcb6be7f8fb35bba1bb003830fac46ddc89e2c5f6cb7edc00e", "ja": "ここでお客さんを掴めたら、大きいぞ！", "zh": "要是能在这里赢得观众的喜爱，那可就不得了了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "d340ed01e10e75f08eb2f6f78cc7139ea2259604141f49f22bd6fd1ce68f0f6d", "ja": "はい！　古き良き伝統の都、京都でのお仕事……\n全身全霊で、がんばります！", "zh": "好的！这次是在拥有悠久美好传统的古都京都工作……\n我会竭尽全力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "f635d07d7fec831360cd42b07d82828d87d9d288ce61c34659b8108c9b218219", "ja": "あっちにいる子たちが、地元のアイドルたちか～。\nすっげー大人っぽくてカワイイな～……。", "zh": "那边那些女孩子，就是当地的偶像啊～。\n超成熟又好可爱哦～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "924f00f5fedfacc37d2d45ff1fb84c6c4c6cd7f4bb738a32a75e427565d449d0", "ja": "共演するユニットの人たちもいますね。\n……大人っぽい。", "zh": "还有要一起演出的组合成员呢。\n……很有大人风范。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "4b450df01922daac4c3f6207b1bbf6ef43f098d72ca5b3d514f3fd308090957b", "ja": "みなさん、とってもお綺麗ですね\nそれに、仕草がたおやかで……♪", "zh": "大家真的都好漂亮呢。\n而且举止也那么优美端庄……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "0aa9719d0cf9e0a49e21b82a46270b0c6907cbd88d988568c7b6a0bfc33c318a", "ja": "むむむ、顔とスタイルもなかなか……。ここは\n亜美が代表して、東西セクシー対決を挑むしか！？", "zh": "唔唔唔，脸蛋和身材也相当不错嘛……这里就只能由亚美代表大家，发起东西方性感对决了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "b069654de7b2af0bb32696a964e7ba9e604c55c3d1efbf1bcf85eeed934baab9", "ja": "いや、ジロジロ見すぎだから……\nちょっと待っててくれ、先に挨拶してくる。", "zh": "不，你盯得太显眼了……\n先稍微等等，我先去打个招呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "eb59ce7837bf270548cb42b8d5e2eff8d8359815e3d95526f7bfdb9b5e63c514", "ja": "ご挨拶が遅れてすみません、765プロです。\n本日はよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "抱歉这么晚才来打招呼，我是765制作人。\n今天请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1033_manager", "source_sha256": "e035b44379ee9c97ec1cf76922c31a1b1dd2ce7669ff81cbf59b1063f0758cc6", "ja": "ああ、これはどうもご丁寧に！\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "啊，您太客气了！\n我这边才要请您多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1034_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "0682c49cdc03b4648d919f7d440b634485916556abdea044753110809979d4a7", "ja": "今日はよろしゅう、プロデューサーさん♪\n東京のお人は、やっぱりしゅっとしてはるわぁ♪", "zh": "今天请多关照啦，制作人♪  \n东京人果然都很干练呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1035_nishiidolb", "source_sha256": "04512ca2b0e31e3e19ab3a940ec519bbcbb00114d1c8f901b644ad7aa0cefbda", "ja": "腕もええんやろな～。\nアイドルさん方の顔見たら、わかりますわぁ。", "zh": "身手肯定也不错吧～\n看看偶像们的脸就知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "11dd3e7730d7a1c301c10ac53072290aa200ea6587e43b9493036bbd46e1eba5", "ja": "いえ、そんな……。今日はアイドル共々、\n精いっぱい努めさせていただきます。では……。", "zh": "哪里的话……今天我和偶像们都会\n全力以赴的。那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1037_nishiidolb", "source_sha256": "a91c211bdee10b05f41cc2cf1882eee196148620cdb1a07667579c620c1f68d7", "ja": "そんな他人行儀にならんといて～。\nほらほら、肩の力を抜いて……♪", "zh": "别这么见外嘛～。\n来来来，放松肩膀……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "ce794ebf92911d70b75c36f948285765dbf86b7476f621de68049f73e1c5c8d6", "ja": "（！？　……い、いつの間に背後に……！？）", "zh": "（！？……什、什么时候跑到我身后来的……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "4db54e32ee13cc2fefae58455a91030de0097df6b97945e2ccfe65e6d8f28c28", "ja": "（それに、朋花のプレッシャーのような……。\nな、なんだ、この逃げられない迫力は……！）", "zh": "（还有，像是朋花的压迫感……。这、这股让人无法逃脱的气势是怎么回事……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1040_032emi", "source_sha256": "7fbe3cc7b4128f27c39ab9a8373dcbad82ba18692a9c28fd15622d097c597062", "ja": "？　なんだか、仕掛け人さまのご様子が……\nWhat！？", "zh": "嗯？总觉得，制作人您的样子……什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1041_033sih", "source_sha256": "9a1731138a65af76303e0b82293898b11abfebf951c1f2ba43bc47a90f62829f", "ja": "あ、あの。{$P$}さん、\nあの人たちに、体を触られていませんか……？", "zh": "那、那个。{$P$}先生，\n你有没有被那些人摸过身体……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1042_011ami", "source_sha256": "e5edb7c32a7f09bf5c57551e6df762ed648c1239cf59b22ecb2d462887bfc157", "ja": "ちょっと兄ちゃん、なに鼻の下伸ばしてんのさー！\n5センチ……いや、10センチはかたいね！", "zh": "喂，大哥，你怎么一副色眯眯的样子呀——！\n都伸长了5厘米……不，肯定有10厘米！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_01_1043_047sub", "source_sha256": "b9c5cf8ff7ea1b72ef18d45f35f0864a5202c8aadc4e28216dc127c65a5e813e", "ja": "{$P$}……まさかあの人たちのこと、\nす、好きになっちゃったとか……！？", "zh": "{$P$}……该、该不会是喜欢上那些人了吧……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
